      "en": "We know that God doesn’t listen to sinners, but if anyone is a worshiper of God and does his will, he listens to him.",
      "ko": "하나님이 죄인을 듣지 아니하시고 경건하여 그의 뜻대로 행하는 자는 들으시는 줄을 우리가 아나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "2cd6baf128ccb54ef7c1b1212c080d309d09d84d9dc26be50f35de2051d47c35",
      "translation_text_hash": "c9e35ce0c03bd361dd4b3df5a917c4abd245655d417b261837a445932632d03a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
